        <head>WARRINGTON CRICKET CLUB.</head>
        <p>WARRINGTON CRICKET CLUB.</p>
        <p>THE RESULTS OF THE SEASON: The Warrington Club concluded their season on Saturday when they drew with Blackley. Of the 24 matches played five were won, eight lost, and eleven drawn. The victories include Bolton, Old- ham, Blackley, Cheetham, and Cheadle Hulme, whilst Sefton (2) Manchester, Liverpool (2) Cheet- ham, Leyland 2) have defeated Warrington. Drawn games have been played with Bolton, Leigh (2), Northern (2), Cheadle Hulme, Manchester, Old- ham, Blackley and Preston (2). The matches with Bootle in both instances were interfered with by rain not a ball being bowled. On June 24th a match was played between the first eleven and the next sivean resulting in an easy victory for the eleven. The scores in this match do not count in the aver- ages etailed below :</p>
      </div>
