        <p>CADBURY'S COCOA is absolutely pure, being entirely free from kola. malt. hone, alkali, or any foreign admixture elution 1 The publie should insist on having CADBURY'S —sold only in Packets andfrins —as other COCOAS are often libatituted for the fake of extra profit.—Advt. (4).</p>
