      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-09-29_WidnesExaminer_art0095" n="art0095">
        <p>and after the second bottle of</p>
        <p>Scott's Emulsion she weighed</p>
        <p>Seventeen Pounds."</p>
