        <head>EARLESTOWN CRICKET CLUB.</head>
        <p>EARLESTOWN CRICKET CLUB.</p>
        <p>AVERAGES-1899. Below will be fouud the batting and bowling averages of the first and second elevens of the Earlestown Cricket Club.. Neither team has done well, as out of the 16 matches played by the first five have been won, nine lost, one drawn, and one tied. Three matches bad to be cancelled owing to inclement wuather. The total number of rung scored was 1535 for 159 wickets averaging 9.104 per wicket. Their opponents scored 2076 runs for 160 wickets, with an average of 12.156 per wicket. The second team played 15 matches, won 6 lost 5, and drew 4. In the batting averages, Huish, the new pro comes out on top with 181 runs per inn- ings, with Husband a good second :</p>
